      "type": "TEXT_BLOCK",
      "heading": "Intent",
      "body": "A confident, cinematic identity grounded in **deep blacks** and a single restrained gold accent. Typography is editorial — long-form serif for headlines, a clean sans for body. We avoid drop-shadows in favour of subtle 1px borders."
